ry_8", "content": " Identifies general information in short written and spoken conversations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  The Present Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Continuous tense to talk about:<ul>  \t<li>events happening now  </li> \t<li>planned events in the near future</li> </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm doing some homework right now."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The form of the Present Continuous tense is: <br/><br/> Subject + to be + v-ing <br/>She is talking to John.<br/>They are going to Costa Rica."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm writing that down now."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We are going to the market tomorrow."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knick-knack "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small object of little value "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going shopping for knick-knacks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a trip."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "handicrafts "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " craft; an object made by hand "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are buying handicrafts at the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "traditional "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "produced or practiced for a long time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going to try traditional Costa Rican foods."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "day trip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a trip that is short and during the day "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going on a day trip to the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " open-air "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "located outside "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going to an open-air market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le03ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le03ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine you are on a trip. Your friends are at home."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue telling them about your trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles and practice again."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example Dialogue\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Jill</span>: Hi, Diana! How's your trip?<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Diana</span>: Hi, Jill. It's great! I'm going to go to the beach tomorrow.<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Jill</span>: Sounds great!<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Diana</span>: Yeah, and we are going to go white-water rafting too!<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Jill</span>: I'm doing homework ... I have to go!<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Diana</span>: Talk to you later!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about traveling."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about plans and intentions."}, {"type": 